# Architecture (KidReader / Godot 4.7)

Kids reading game (letter drag-and-drop onto slots; realistic animal photo behind blur). Prefer the smallest change that fits existing patterns. Do not invent parallel systems.

Godot 4.x only: `@export`/`@onready`, `signal.connect(cb)`, `instantiate()`, typed GDScript, `Input` actions.

## Stable references (critical)

- Prefer `class_name` + typed use over `preload("res://path/script.gd")`
- Prefer `@export` / `@export_file` / PackedScene assigned in the editor
- Do not add new path constants for scripts/resources unless no other option

## Target platforms (critical)

Ship on **Mobile**, **desktop**, **HTML5**. Every control must work with touch and mouse. Large finger-friendly hit targets. Isolate `OS.has_feature(...)` behind helpers.

## #1 Scene isolation (critical)

Every scene must F6-run alone. Bake safe defaults into `.tres` / `@export`. Parents override at runtime via events → `initialize(data)` → `ResourceUtils.update_resource`.

## Entry & folders

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `main.tscn` → `src/game/main.gd` | HFSM bootstrap host |
| `src/game/scenes/` | Screens: `app_root`, `menu` (zoo map ⇄ zone), `game` |
| `src/features/` | Isolated gameplay features |
| `src/common/` | Shared Resources (`LevelData`, `ZoneData`, `RegionData`, `LevelsCatalog`, settings helpers) |
| `src/ui/` | Shared UI: parental gate, icon button, loading, `PhotoSticker`, `SignPlate`, `DragScroll`, `styles/` |
| `src/levels/` | Generated campaign: `level_<id>.tres`, `zones/`, `regions/` |
| `core/` | Project-agnostic only (HFSM, FSM, EventListener, ResourceUtils, shackers, window stack) |
| `concepts/` | AI style reference only — never loaded by game |
| `assets/` | Runtime art/audio/fonts |

## Layer contracts

### `src/features/`
- One folder = one feature (`letter_tile`, `word_slot`, `animal`, `celebration`, `music`, `sfx`, `audio_duck`)
- Public surface: signals `ev_*`, `initialize`/`setup`, exported PackedScenes
- Features must not import other features' internals
- Level SFX + AudioDuck live on `game.tscn`; looping music on AppRoot `MusicPlayer`
- Animal reveal = blur shader on photo (not ice cage); `ice_layer` is legacy, unused

### `core/`
- Must not depend on `src/`

### `src/game/scenes/`
- Orchestration only; compose features; own screen FSM/UI

## UI — editor-first

All static UI (known in advance) → `.tscn`/`.tres`; scripts bind `@export` and update state. Only data-driven UI is built in code, via template `.tscn`. See `ui-scenes.mdc`.

## Context flow

```
Menu --ev.start_level--> Level
Level --ev.open_menu--> Menu
Level --ev.start_level--> Level (next / retry remount)
```

App phases via HFSM (`src/game/hfsm/app_hfsm.json`). Bridge: `RootEvents` on `app_root` → `hfsm.add_event`. In-level: `GameEvents` + `GameManager` FSM.

## Placement

- New gameplay unit → `src/features/{name}/`
- New screen → `src/game/scenes/{name}/`
- Shared Resource → `src/common/`
- Campaign content → edit the table in `tools/gen_zoo_content.py` and regenerate (never hand-edit `src/levels/`)
- Progress mutations → `ProgressController`; disk only via `RootEvents.ev_save_progress` → `SaveManager`
